<title>PORTUGAL: Bank/Portugal cuts discount rate to 7.00 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank/Portugal cuts discount rate to 7.00 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Portugal cut its discount rate by 1.25 percentage points to 7.00 percent, effective tomorrow, according to a statement published in the official Diario da Republica.</p>
<p>The discount rate is used in various operations not linked to the financial markets such as judicial decisions, contracts between members of the public and home loan agreements for bank employees.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
